    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandma\u2019s House</strong> is a first-person horror game with online co-op support. Play as Jo\u00e3o, a boy traveling during his vacation to visit his grandmother, just like every summer. But this time... something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should have been just another peaceful visit quickly turns into an experience filled with tension, mystery, and unexplainable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse environments, solve challenging puzzles, and dive into a story divided into chapters\u2014each bringing new locations and hidden secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in online co-op mode, and face together the dangers lurking in every corner of this journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandma\u2019s House</strong> is a first-person horror game with online co-op support. Play as Jo\u00e3o, a boy traveling during his vacation to visit his grandmother, just like every summer. But this time... something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should have been just another peaceful visit quickly turns into an experience filled with tension, mystery, and unexplainable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse environments, solve challenging puzzles, and dive into a story divided into chapters\u2014each bringing new locations and hidden secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in online co-op mode, and face together the dangers lurking in every corner of this journey.</p>",
    "short_description": "Summer vacations were always the same. But this time, as Jo\u00e3o travels to visit his grandmother, he realizes something is wrong. What begins as an ordinary visit soon turns into a journey of fear, mystery, and survival against the unexplainable.",
